        <item>
            <title>2.32.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 16:30:51 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>116</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.32.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The sidebar's usage footer now shows which account you are signed in as, above the 5-hour / weekly / per-model rate-limit bars.
- Rate limits are tracked per account. When an SSH remote session is signed in to a different Claude account than this Mac, the footer shows a separate block for that account — email plus its own bars — instead of flipping between the two. With a single account nothing changes.

### Changes
- Every row in the usage footer now starts on the same left edge; the MacroPad indicator moved to the right end of the version row.

### Bug Fixes
- The chat composer's prompt-cache countdown no longer reads "likely expired" right after Canopy's keep-alive refresh has re-armed the cache. The refresh's usage now reaches the extension, while the refresh turn itself stays off screen and out of the ↑ prompt history.
]]></description>
