        <item>
            <title>2.31.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 13:10:08 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>115</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.31.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Images Claude reads with the Read tool are now shown in the Canopy Mobile session view
- Prompts sent from the phone to a busy session are now queued and delivered in order once the session is free, instead of being refused. Replies to a session waiting on a permission prompt or a question are still returned to the phone
- The MacroPad indicator now tells you when another process is holding the pad's port, instead of showing "searching" indefinitely

### Changes
- When a session fails to start, or its Claude process stops accepting input, the reason is now shown in the launcher once the session closes

### Bug Fixes
- Fixed Canopy quitting outright when a background process it was writing to exited unexpectedly
- Fixed new worktrees sticking on "Copying Build Files…" for up to five minutes after the copy had already finished
- A failure to list a repository's ignored files while seeding a worktree is now reported instead of silently copying nothing
]]></description>
