        <item>
            <title>2.30.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:24:10 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>114</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.30.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Restart session** — rebuilds a session's shim and web view in place, keeping its sidebar row, its pane and that pane's width. Closing and reopening a session loses all three. This is also the only way to pick up a newly installed Claude Code extension build, and the way to recover a session whose CLI has stopped responding without losing where it sat.
- **Open in Finder** — opens the session's directory.
- **Right-click a pane header** for the same menu the sidebar row offers.

### Bug Fixes

- Shift+Return inserts a newline in the launcher's prompt box. It previously did nothing at all, so the first prompt could not be written across multiple lines.
- A MacroPad key press now puts the caret in that pane's chat input even when the pane is already focused — the gesture the pad exists for. It only ever worked when the press changed which pane was focused.
- The focus ring drawn on a right-clicked sidebar row now lines up with the row instead of sitting a few points off.
]]></description>
